Doors.. The *only* thing I would like to be changed is that you *can't* see
beforehand if the door is open or closed! This can be serious if you are
running away from a monster. Then you bump into one and loose a turn!

One way to remedy this could be to make open doors look different than closed
ones. Perhaps locked doors would be reversed and open doors/no door would be
normal. 

The other way: make '/' command identify open and closed doors! Instead of
+    a door (or a spell book)
It would properly identify the door:
+    an open door
+    a closed door
+    a spellbook

